o the fortress and she can  also manipulate the building itself  shifting its position and creating  doorways wherever she wishes  in addition na kima has the ability to  detach eyeballs from her body and use  them to effectively spy on her targets  from a great distance next up we have a  casa the upper moon three demon and my  brother goes ins favorite upper moon as  a human a casa was a martial artist who  used a barehanded fighting style and as  a demon his blood demon art essentially  turns him into a superhuman martial  artist he uses powerful physical attacks  mostly punches and kicks which create  massive shock waves and he has the  ability to sense his opponents bloodlust  and detect where his opponents attacks  are coming from now let's talk about  DOMA also known as upper moon - his  blood demon art basically allows him to  create various ice based attacks such as  razor sharp wind gusts freezing ice  clouds ice lotuses ice piers and even  small ice clones of himself that can  fight his opponents for him his most  powerful attack allows him to create a  massive ice statue that uses ice based  attacks to assault his targets and now  we get to the strongest upper moon upper  moon one kakushi bow this demon is  capable of using his own unique breath  style called breath of the moon but he  does also have other demonic abilities  his blood demon art allows him to  separate a part of his own flesh from  his body and turn it into a sword this  sword is covered with demonic eyes and  kakushi bow frequently uses it in battle  the eyes and the sword increased a range  of his vision and because the sword is  made of his own demonic flesh kakushi  bow can changed the shape and size of  the blade and encase the blade is  damaged he can easily repair it since a  demon's flesh can quickly regenerate  this demon is a master swordsman and his  power is equivalent to the power of  multiple Hasina's put together believe  it or not there is also a human who is  not a demon 